gon(){return"Import"},
gos(){return"Spreadsheet imported"},
gtC(){return"Google Sheets"},
gtB(){return"Statistics can share a spreadsheet for Google Sheets or Excel. Edit the sets at home, download CSV, and import it back. Keep the id columns, and keep each exercise's rows together in order. A workout in the file replaces its sets. Workouts missing from the file stay. A client's name, goal, and notes come from the first filled row. The exercise note and the session note come back with the file. A file without those columns does not erase notes already on the phone. JSON is still the full backup."},
